      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I know full well what you are thinking,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the schemes by which you would wrong me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You say, 'Where now is the house of the great,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the tents where the wicked lived?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you never questioned those who travel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Have you paid no regard to their accounts—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the wicked are spared from the day of calamity,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that they are delivered from",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the day of wrath?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who denounces their conduct to their face?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who repays them for what they have done?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are carried to the grave,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and watch is kept over their tombs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The soil in the valley is sweet to them;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "everyone follows after them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and a countless throng goes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "before them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So how can you console me with your nonsense?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 21:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing is left of your answers but falsehood!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
